UnitAccessRouter::Constructor
├── When opsAdminRoles contains DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE
│   └── It reverts with AdminRoleEscalation
├── When opsAdminRoles contains OPS_ADMIN_ROLE
│   └── It reverts with AdminRoleEscalation
└── When called with valid opsAdminRoles
    ├── It sets the DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE
    ├── It sets the OPS_ADMIN_ROLE
    ├── It sets the UPGRADER_ROLE
    ├── It sets the PAUSER_ROLE
    ├── It sets the UNPAUSER_ROLE
    ├── It sets the ENTRYPOINT_MANAGER_ROLE
    ├── It sets the POSTMAN_ROLE
    ├── It sets DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE to manage timelocked roles
    └── It sets OPS_ADMIN_ROLE to manage operational roles
